BLgQ7kNvwGi6RRr&_nc_oc=AdlQhjQTVulSdTBJ5gqvjh-1Vyu0DTqJWReReAsSPYwTIcKbQdipBdtQUcW3fhAe9M0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftxqJSAurH7t9sxdP4hCG66MERbT33u0J4zQVoqwEDM1g&oe=69A59432"}, {"file_name": "landscape_4.png", "id": "5564456170299960", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/65402515_5564456173633293_8166203934336264507_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_fnv1eQmc5kQ7kNvwEr8sFY&_nc_oc=Admp8-su7GaioUA9XPFcxDpRlFZhkJzDhBNHzh2CEpfgPf0Rx-jaBAk6NaCXizcQ1yQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft3yUCieSrRbu5xECj1IdUSac4THFNlSonC0niQNOSy3A&oe=69A574F6"}, {"file_name": "landscape_5.png", "id": "634797031492068", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001717_634797034825401_6944852042907467801_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rDyjt5BydYYQ7kNvwFENOse&_nc_oc=AdmszgU1mv77XaC9MYcrOWXZVzQZ-pzgXBsPusbv1ufDI5Ces2h4uNI-7ypxUJmFy0A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuZAm_N_1_OPov_zdVdkEu5wT4p5Ehls_gyUAmNCQA-Lw&oe=69A592EB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Notre-Dame de Paris: Voyage dans le Pass\u00e9", "keywords": ["NotreDameDeParis", "NotreDame", "Paris"], "long_description": "(Re)-d\u00e9couvrez Notre-Dame de Paris telle qu\u2019elle \u00e9tait il y a 2 si\u00e8cles, pendant la R\u00e9volution Fran\u00e7aise. Au c\u0153ur du jeu vid\u00e9o Assassin\u2019s Creed : Unity, la reconstitution 3D de la cath\u00e9drale a n\u00e9cessit\u00e9 5000 heures de travail graphique, guid\u00e9 par des historiens.\nDe la nef \u00e0 la fl\u00e8che, admirez chaque perspective du monument, et finissez par un spectaculaire voyage en ballon au-dessus des arches, et de Paris \u00e0 la fin du XVIII\u00e8me si\u00e8cle. Le tout au son d\u2019une fantaisie de Bach jou\u00e9e sur le c\u00e9l\u00e8bre orgue Cavaill\u00e9-Coll !", "short_description": "Ubisoft propose une visite en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle de Notre-Dame de Paris \